<title>USA: SOCCER-UNITED STATES BEAT COSTA RICA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UNITED STATES BEAT COSTA RICA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, California 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States</p>
<p>beat Costa Rica 2-1 (halftime 1-0) in a CONCACAF Group A World</p>
<p>Cup qualifying match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>United States - Brian McBride (17th minute), Roy Lassiter</p>
<p>(60th)</p>
<p>Costa Rica - Ronald Gomez (75th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,527</p>
</text>
